{"version": 2, "width": 100, "height": 34, "title": "Read-only SQL Assistant \u2014 edited-paced replay of actual outputs", "env": {"TERM": "xterm-256color"}}
[0, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[HRead-only SQL Assistant\r\nWhat this project demonstrates\r\n\r\nAn LLM may propose SQL, but a separate SQLite read-only URI, query-only connection and authorizer decide whether it can run. Table/function allowlists, operation limits and row caps constrain execution.\r\n"]
[10, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[HRead-only SQL Assistant\r\nActual fixture demo output\r\n\r\n{\r\n  \"mode\": \"fixture\",\r\n  \"python\": \"3.12.13\",\r\n  \"recorded_at\": \"2026-10-31T13:52:21.579171+00:00\",\r\n  \"elapsed_seconds\": 0.002,\r\n  \"result\": {\r\n    \"sql\": \"SELECT region, SUM(amount_cents) AS revenue_cents FROM orders GROUP BY region ORDER BY region\",\r\n    \"result\": {\r\n      \"columns\": [\r\n        \"region\",\r\n        \"revenue_cents\"\r\n      ],\r\n      \"rows\": [\r\n        [\r\n          \"Romania\",\r\n          23500\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          \"Spain\",\r\n          19000\r\n        ]\r\n      ],\r\n      \"truncated\": false\r\n    },\r\n    \"mode\": \"fixture\",\r\n    \"write_blocked\": \"Query blocked or invalid: not authorized\"\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n"]
[20, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[HRead-only SQL Assistant\r\nBehavior under test\r\n\r\n........                                                                 [100%]\r\n8 passed in 0.06s"]
[30, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[HRead-only SQL Assistant\r\nMeasured evaluation / fixture mode\r\n\r\n{\r\n  \"passed\": true,\r\n  \"scenario\": {\r\n    \"sql\": \"SELECT region, SUM(amount_cents) AS revenue_cents FROM orders GROUP BY region ORDER BY region\",\r\n    \"result\": {\r\n      \"columns\": [\r\n        \"region\",\r\n        \"revenue_cents\"\r\n      ],\r\n      \"rows\": [\r\n        [\r\n          \"Romania\",\r\n          23500\r\n        ],\r\n        [\r\n          \"Spain\",\r\n          19000\r\n        ]\r\n      ],\r\n      \"truncated\": false\r\n    },\r\n    \"mode\": \"fixture\",\r\n    \"write_blocked\": \"Query blocked or invalid: not authorized\"\r\n  }\r\n}"]
[40, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[HRead-only SQL Assistant\r\nTradeoffs to explain at interview\r\n\r\nOnly one synthetic orders table and a small function allowlist are supported. It is not a general SQL firewall for arbitrary databases. Real-model query correctness is demonstrated on one simple aggregate.\r\n"]
[50, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[HRead-only SQL Assistant\r\nRun it yourself\r\n\r\ngit clone https://github.com/danielpdev/readonly-sql-assistant.git\r\ncd readonly-sql-assistant\r\nmake setup\r\nmake demo\r\nmake test\r\nmake eval\r\n\r\nSee README.md and docs/INTERVIEW_RO.md.\r\n\r\nAI-assisted portfolio project. Synthetic data.\r\nNo production customer claims."]
